===Origin===
*Both of this card's illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Greavard|104}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*'''Soul Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mega Rising|Cofagrigus|111}} from the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

